{"unit_id":"fengyevvv__dsh-egress-router#caveat-1","repo":"fengyevvv/dsh-egress-router","commit":"9e09a1f64687ba797bf63a6b1635ebe3cee77f32","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-egress-router 使用前须知：README 顶部称代理不可用时会全部直连，但代码默认继续使用代理，只有应急名单中的主机绕过代理；名单外请求仍经代理。见 lib/policy.js:148-189。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/policy.js:148-189","README.md:3-8"]}
